Brouwer's fixed-point theorem on nonempty compact convex sets.

Source under the MIT license reproduced in LICENSE:
  https://github.com/harfe/fixed-point-theorems-lean4
  revision 93a3eed3364281a9dbf9652bb52356a8db65057c

The five modules form the import closure of FixedPointTheorems.brouwer.
The upstream proof uses cubical Sperner labeling. The Argand finite-horizon
reachability theorem applies it to a closed ball of free initial coordinates.
The three uses of toContinuousMap in brouwer.lean use its Mathlib 4.36
name, ContinuousMap.ofClass.
